                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Its really not a bad game, sure it looks crappy on the outside and doesnt have 4k graffics. But it's not the graffics that count its the story.\n\nThe story is a little cheesy yet has a good element to it. Its a little funny here and there. Also the story has a good plot and moves along quite well. Battles can be hard, while the game can be giving at times it can taketh away even faster.\n\nI like it.",
